# DESIGN ENGINEERING
Before writing any animation or UI code, consult `.cursor/rules/emil-design-refs/emil-design-eng.md`. 
Crucial rules: NEVER use `ease-in` for UI. Keep durations under 300ms. Never animate from `scale(0)`.
